# Quick Boundaries

- `src/core` — pure TypeScript, no SDKs, no React, no imports from infrastructure/app/lib
- `src/infrastructure` — implements ports, may use SDKs
- `src/app/api/**/route.ts` — Zod validation + DI (only place to instantiate adapters)
- `src/lib/api` — React Query hooks + Axios; no infrastructure imports
- UI — calls server via React Query hooks only

